Menu cursor fix: converts relative mouse deltas from physical pixels to the engine's scaled 2D coordinates (client/in_generic.c).

Apply from the root of the idTech4A++ checkout (tag v1.1.0harmattan73):
    git apply --check --whitespace=nowarn nzp-fteqw-cursor.patch && git apply --whitespace=nowarn nzp-fteqw-cursor.patch

